<!--
  Only the routes that are a real PAGE — one with content a crawler can read and
  a canonical URL that matches (see `applyRouteMeta` in src/seo.ts). Live-session
  surfaces (play / lobby / ranked / replay / account) are deliberately absent and
  also Disallowed in robots.txt.

  `/` is the SITE home. `/decode` and `/chain` are the two GAMES' landing pages,
  each self-canonical with its own title and description, so both can be indexed
  in their own right (and so either can turn up as a sitelink under the home
  result). Which one a given URL canonicalizes to is decided by the URL that was
  actually opened — see `ENTRY_HAS_GAME` in src/ui/App.tsx.
-->
